  {
    "ability_id": "ABL-012-01",
    "role_id": "ROLE-012",
    "canonical_name": "Magician",
    "phase": "Night",
    "trigger_type": "Nightly; power selected before game",
    "action_type": "Choose Power",
    "target_type": "Varies",
    "usage_limit": "Varies",
    "priority": 35,
    "condition_notes": "Nightly; power selected before game",
    "effect_notes": "The Magician gets to use a different nighttime power each night. Here's how it works: Before the game, the Moderator puts several nighttime-active roles in a pile (while he may reveal those roles to the players, it's better if he doesn't), and then each night, including the first night, he shows one of those cards to the magician, who may then use that special power. If he shows the Magician the Seer (this can happen because all you Kickstarter backers have at least one extra Seer), the Magician points to a player and learns if he is a werewolf. If he's shown the Insomniac, he'll be told if a player on either side of him woke up that night. If he's shown the Leprechaun, he can retarget who the werewolves selected. It's a fun, dynamic and exciting role that can really help the village!"
  },
